OL,3,GNEWSAHedgelayers compete in 'mysterious
OL,4,Acraft' showcase
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than a 100 hedgelayers have taken
OL,7,Fpart in an annual competition to find
OL,8,Fout who is a cut above the rest when it
OL,9,Fcomes to the traditional countryside
OL,10,Fcraft.
OL,12,FSaturday saw the 47th National
OL,13,FHedgelaying Championship take place
OL,14,Fnear Chipping Norton, with 115
OL,15,Fcompetitors vying for the overall
OL,16,Ftitle.
OL,18,FEach entrant was given five hours to
OL,19,Fshowcase one of eight regional
OL,20,Fvariations of hedge - with Welshman
OL,21,FChris Davies crowned overall supreme
OL,22,Fchampion.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
