OL,3,GNEWSAHedgelayers compete in 'mysterious
OL,4,Acraft' showcase
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigel Adams, from Christmas Common in
OL,7,FOxfordshire, finished second and said
OL,8,Fhedgelaying - which is used to manage
OL,9,Frows and create barriers for livestock
OL,10,F- was a "mysterious craft".
